UI Controls — New Lines
--------------------------------

await expect(checkBox).toBeChecked();

→ Verifies that the checkbox is checked.
→ If checked → PASS
→ If not checked → FAIL

await checkBox.uncheck();

→ Unchecks/deselects the checkbox.

await expect(checkBox).not.toBeChecked();

→ Verifies that the checkbox is NOT checked.
→ If unchecked → PASS
→ If checked → FAIL

expect(await checkBox.isChecked()).toBeFalsy();

→ isChecked() checks whether the checkbox is currently checked.
→ toBeFalsy() verifies that the result is false.

In simple terms:
	Verify that the checkbox is not checked.
	
expect(await radioBtns.last().isChecked()).toBeTruthy();

→ Selects the last radio button.
→ isChecked() checks whether it is selected.
→ toBeTruthy() verifies that the result is true.

In simple terms:
	Verify that the last radio button is selected.
	
	
